---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout>
    <section class="section section-alt">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>Software</h1>

            <p>
                My background in software engineering informs how I approach astronomy, scientific computing, and technical problem-solving. I am particularly interested in developing tools that support astronomical observations, data analysis, visualization, automation, and reproducible scientific workflows.
            </p>

            <p>
                This section will document software developed for astronomy, scientific computing, and related technical projects. Entries may include standalone applications, data-processing tools, observational utilities, automation scripts, and reusable software components.
            </p>

            <section class="software-section">
                <h2>Areas of Interest</h2>

                <div class="software-grid">
                    <article class="software-area">
                        <h3>Scientific Computing</h3>
                        <p>
                            Developing computational tools for scientific analysis, numerical workflows, and research-oriented applications.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="software-area">
                        <h3>Data Analysis</h3>
                        <p>
                            Processing and interpreting astronomical data using structured, repeatable, and testable workflows.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="software-area">
                        <h3>Visualization</h3>
                        <p>
                            Creating clear visual representations of astronomical observations, measurements, and scientific results.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="software-area">
                        <h3>Automation</h3>
                        <p>
                            Building utilities that reduce repetitive work in observing, image processing, data organization, and analysis.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="software-area">
                        <h3>Web Tools for Astronomy</h3>
                        <p>
                            Applying web technologies to astronomical documentation, observing workflows, data access, and public-facing scientific resources.
                        </p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="software-archive">
                <h2>Software Archive</h2>

                <p>
                    Software projects will be added here as they are developed.
                </p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
    .software-section,
    .software-archive {
        margin-top: 3rem;
    }

    .software-grid {
        display: grid;
        gap: 2rem;
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    @media (min-width: 800px) {
        .software-grid {
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        }
    }
</style>